  "bio": "Wendy Tattoo, located in Magione, Italy, is renowned for her exquisite fineline tattooing that beautifully melds the intricacies of blackwork with henna-inspired designs. Clients regard Wendy as the epitome of professionalism in the tattoo industry, consistently providing a service that not only meets but exceeds expectations in both skill and artistic execution. Her commitment to maintaining a sterile and immaculate workspace ensures every session is as safe as it is transformative.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Magione, Umbria, Italy"
